WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.920
If not, it's over.

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:04.400
That's how you have to live your life.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.760
When that long clock goes off at 4 or 5 in the morning,

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.360
your mind says no.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.960
And all I knew back then was hard work.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.920
The only way anything gets accomplished,

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.360
you gotta work hard.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:17.440
You gotta work hard.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.760
I can't get this paragraph.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.840
I can't remember what to this paragraph

00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.000
to pass this test to get in the military.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.480
Read again.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:25.320
Still not getting it.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.280
Read again.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.320
But if not getting it, write it out.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.920
And that's how I started learning.
